# omegacentauri.me — Apache configuration
#
# Vendored from AINumbers/repo/.htaccess (shared-infra doctrine: one lineage,
# never fork). Same DreamHost shared-hosting setup, same slug-rename-301 pattern.
#
# WHY THIS FILE IS TRACKED, NOT HAND-EDITED ON THE HOST:
# the deploy rsync is moving to --delete. Anything in the web root that is not
# in this repo gets removed on the next deploy. A host-side .htaccess would be
# destroyed by the very first --delete run, taking every redirect below with it.
# Edit here, commit, deploy.
#
# See OCS-PROD-ORPHAN-ASSETS-ISSUE.md for the full background.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Slug-rename 301s
#
# Generated from `git log --diff-filter=R -M --name-status main` — one line per
# path that has ever been renamed on main. Because the deploy has run without
# --delete since inception, every one of these old paths is still sitting on the
# host serving a stale copy of the page, self-canonicalizing as a distinct
# document. These redirects fold each one into its successor.
#
# Two waves are represented:
#   - 2026-06-09  demo-* → scenario-*  (30 pages)
#   - earlier     review.html, campaign.html → spelled-out slugs
#
# The demo-bh-tap → scenario-bh-tap rename went through an intermediate
# empty-basename commit (tools/.html); the redirect below collapses that chain
# to its endpoint. tools/.html itself is not redirected — it was never a real
# published URL.
#
# To regenerate after a future rename wave, re-run the diff-filter=R command and
# append the new pairs. Do not remove old lines: inbound links and search-engine
# records outlive the file.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Redirect 301 /campaign.html /omega-centauri-technosignature-campaign.html
Redirect 301 /review.html /inward-migration-fermi-paradox-review.html

# demo-* → scenario-* (2026-06-09)
Redirect 301 /tools/demo-bh-physics.html /tools/scenario-bh-physics.html
Redirect 301 /tools/demo-bh-tap.html /tools/scenario-bh-tap.html
Redirect 301 /tools/demo-breaking-degeneracy.html /tools/scenario-breaking-degeneracy.html
